id: pm-954h0o
title: "GH-682: linked-test tracker sandbox must preserve source VCS workspace identity"
description: Preserve an explicit read-only source workspace and VCS root when pm test executes with a sandboxed tracker so Git-aware SDK and package commands observe the same tags and repository metadata as direct execution while tracker writes remain isolated.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[7]: "area:sdk","area:test",context-management,gh-issue,packages,sandbox,vcs
