author: codex-root
parent: pm-ugqx
release: v2026.7.25
resolution: Separated sandboxed tracker storage from explicit read-only source workspace identity in linked-test execution and governance validation.
expected_result: Linked tests remain storage-isolated while Git and linked-file validation resolve against the real source workspace.
actual_result: Packed installed-consumer acceptance ran a real linked test with isolated PM roots and correct source VCS/file resolution.
