comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:15:28.871Z",codex-root,"Duplicate check: searched every status for GH-682, linked-test sandbox PM_PATH Git context, tracker source workspace identity, release tags, and pm-changelog linked tests. Existing linked-test and SDK work does not own the distinct split between isolated tracker storage and read-only source VCS identity."
  "2026-07-25T00:58:53.168Z",codex-root,"Scope extension from GH-689: preserving PM_SOURCE_WORKSPACE_ROOT for extension context is insufficient unless nested pm validate --check-files resolves linked repository artifacts against that source workspace while PM_PATH remains the isolated tracker. Acceptance now includes a nested package-script regression proving storage isolation and source file resolution coexist."
  "2026-07-25T00:59:00.326Z",codex-root,"Scope extension from GH-689: preserving PM_SOURCE_WORKSPACE_ROOT for extension context is insufficient unless nested pm validate --check-files resolves linked repository artifacts against that source workspace while PM_PATH remains the isolated tracker. Acceptance now includes a nested package-script regression proving storage isolation and source file resolution coexist."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:10.164Z","harness:codex","Evidence: extension option parsing now rejects unknown keys, preserves commas inside structured values, handles repeatable/list semantics deterministically, and validates defaults through the same contract path. Unit, contract snapshot, packed-consumer, package-first dogfood, and full coverage gates pass."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:48.321Z","harness:codex","Correction to the immediately preceding evidence comment: this item owns linked-test source VCS identity. Evidence: execution propagates source_workspace_root while PM_PATH and PM_GLOBAL_PATH stay sandboxed; an installed tarball consumer ran a real linked test successfully."
